&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Dashlane&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 0.0in;&quot;&gt;Dashlane’s mission is to deliver the credential security every business and employee needs to thrive. Millions of consumers, and over 25,000 brands worldwide, such as Michelin, Air France, and Forrester, trust Dashlane for industry-leading innovations, patented zero-knowledge security, and an unmatched user experience. Founded in Paris, Dashlane has since established offices in New York and Lisbon, and has grown to more than 300 Dashlaners globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 0.0in;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for people who actively use AI tools to drive efficiency, creativity, and impact in their work. At Dashlane, we drive innovation and value learning, strive for excellence in everything we do, and thrive as one team. Learn more about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;life at Dashlane&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, including &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/how-we-work&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;how we work&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/how-we-hire&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;how we hire&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and the &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/benefits-dashlane&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;benefits of being a Dashlaner&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 0.0in;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dashlane is currently looking for an experienced, hands-on &lt;strong&gt;Lead Accountant&lt;/strong&gt; to take end-to-end ownership of our French entity’s financial operations as our primary local finance lead in Paris. Reporting directly into the US-based VP, Global Controller, this high-impact role places you at the center of a dynamic, international team where you will manage everything from local statutory compliance to global reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this position based in Paris, you will lead day-to-day accounting operations: spanning General Ledger, Month-End Close, Payroll oversight, Revenue Recognition (US GAAP ASC 606), VAT/Tax filings, CIR preparation, and the annual French Statutory Audit, while collaborating closely with international teams across the US and Portugal. You will modernize workflows through automation, champion the adoption of AI-assisted accounting tools, and mentor our local Staff Accountant to support their professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-specific information:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be based in Paris, with English and French as your working languages. We offer a&amp;nbsp;hybrid work arrangement, with Monday, Tuesday and Thursday in-office, and Wednesday&amp;nbsp;and Friday as remote. Tuesday is the office company-sponsored meal.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End French Accounting Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the complete month-end close process for the French entity and maintain local accounting books in close collaboration with the global accounting team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Statutory Audit &amp;amp; Tax Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the annual French Statutory Audit, manage tax/VAT filings, and coordinate the annual CIR (Crédit d&#39;Impôt Recherche) preparation with Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Financial Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with the Global Controller on the annual US GAAP audit, internal controls, and special international accounting projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue Recognition &amp;amp; B2B Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage US GAAP ASC 606 revenue recognition, support payment automation, and oversee B2B invoicing, AR collections, and local compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational &amp;amp; Payroll Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor third-party payroll JEs and accruals, process vendor bills and credit cards with proper GL coding, manage T&amp;amp;E compliance, and perform balance sheet reconciliations (bank, fixed assets, and balance sheet).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Leadership &amp;amp; System Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Optimize French accounting systems (Pennylane ERP) and lead project management for the 2027 French e-invoicing compliance initiatives across AP and AR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatic Decision-Making:&lt;/strong&gt; Navigate ambiguity to make sound accounting decisions with incomplete data in a fast-paced environment, balancing technical precision with operational flexibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Foster an open, supportive environment by sharing knowledge, managing workload to hit tight deadlines, and collaborating across global and local teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder &amp;amp; Vendor Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Build strong professional relationships with external third parties, including payroll vendors, audit firms, and statutory partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Create and regularly update internal process documentation to ensure financial data integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Workflow Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Modernize French accounting operations by adopting AI-assisted tools and automated workflows to accelerate reconciliations, month-end close, AR/AP, and accruals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Accounting or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of relevant accounting and tax experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong French Statutory accounting knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GAAP - ASC 606 Revenue Recognition knowledge (particularly within subscription or multi-channel B2B payment models)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in French and English (spoken and written)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Pennylane and NetSuite or other large ERP systems (or similar modern financial platforms)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel skills (for complex data analysis, reconciliations, and financial modeling)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail and accuracy, structured and autonomous working style&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic business judgment and ability to balance technical accounting precision with operational speed, applying a sharp sense of materiality to navigate ambiguity and solve complex issues in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine passion for sharing knowledge and fostering an open, supportive team environment, focusing on coaching, empowering, and elevating colleagues&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and diplomacy skills to build seamless, high-trust relationships across international internal teams and key external partners (auditors, payroll vendors, tax authorities).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to take full accountability for local financial outcomes, bringing a proactive, solution-oriented approach to organizing priorities, resolving operational challenges, and consistently delivering under tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Are Also Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US GAAP accounting knowledge&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong enthusiasm for AI and digital transformation, with a drive to leverage modern AI tools and workflow automation to streamline reconciliations, close processes, and financial reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct hands-on experience coordinating annual French R&amp;amp;D tax credit (CIR) preparations alongside technical and engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to collaborate across time zones and enthusiasm to connect in person at our global hubs in Lisbon and the US 2–3 times per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;What Dashlane offers you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Equal Parental leave -&amp;nbsp; regardless of gender, up to 20 weeks fully paid leave to take care of their new baby, within the first year of birth or adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Health insurance covered by Dashlane&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Mentorship program - select your mentor from our internal pool and continue your learning path!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Commute allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Meal Vouchers (Swile)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Mental health services through Spring Health for you and family members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;4 extra days off (one per quarter) to acknowledge the importance of your wellbeing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Spot in daycare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Time off saving account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Donation matching program -&amp;nbsp; give back to the community and support actions that lead to positive social impact under the historically marginalized communities. Every donation will be matched by Dashlane&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Team buildings &amp;amp; seasonal social events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Weekly lunch in the office and monthly happy hour and many more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity, Inclusion and Belonging at Dashlane:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a truly international company—founded in France and &lt;span style=&quot;color: #172b4d;&quot;&gt;distributed across&lt;/span&gt; France, US and Portugal—Dashlane thrives off diverse perspectives. We value all aspects of diversity: gender identity, sexual orientation, ability, ethnic origin, social background, age, lifestyle, and more. We are committed to hiring a diverse community and fostering a culture where everyone is heard and belongs. See more about this &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/diversity&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;d1c12b7e-4df1-44c5-a10f-2644909c66db&quot;&gt;Your interview experience:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To know what to expect once you’ve sent your application, &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/how-we-hire&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read about how we interview and hire at Dashlane&lt;/a&gt;. Feel free to browse our blog to find more information about our product and how we work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to the future of cloud networking and security!&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Cato Networks is the first company to converge enterprise networking and security into one centralized and global service that is delivered by cloud. It is led by networking and security pioneer Shlomo Kramer (Check Point, Imperva) and early investor (Palo Alto Networks, Exabeam, Trusteer and more). Cato’s unique technology inspired a brand-new product category, later named “SASE” by Gartner and a market expected to reach $28.5 billion by 2028.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is your opportunity to get on the rocket ship and join a company that is building a cutting-edge enterprise network and secure cloud platform, and is on a fast track to becoming the worldwide market leader – don’t miss it!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking a Commercial Account Executive who is eager to drive growth within the SMB and mid-market segments. If you’re excited about connecting with businesses, solving problems, and delivering cutting-edge solutions, we’d love to have you on our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Sales Cycle: &lt;/strong&gt;Manage the entire sales process for SMB and mid-market accounts, from lead generation to closing, ensuring customers receive real value from our solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engage with Decision-Makers: &lt;/strong&gt;Reach out to key business decision-makers (CEOs, CTOs, IT Directors) to understand their challenges and align our cybersecurity and SaaS offerings to meet their needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Focus on Customer Success: &lt;/strong&gt;Help SMB and mid-market businesses grow securely by positioning our solutions as critical to their long-term success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage Shorter Sales Cycles: &lt;/strong&gt;Navigate faster-paced sales cycles, building relationships and managing multiple opportunities while driving results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Approach: &lt;/strong&gt;Leverage CRM data, sales tools, and metrics to track performance, refine strategies, and optimize outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with the Team: &lt;/strong&gt;Work closely with your colleagues, sharing tips, strategies, and best practices to drive success across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expand Market Reach: &lt;/strong&gt;Build strong partnerships with local MSSPs, VARs, and other key stakeholders to bring our solutions to more SMB and mid-market organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay Ahead of the Curve: &lt;/strong&gt;Stay updated on the latest trends in cybersecurity and SaaS, positioning yourself as a valuable resource to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;: 3-5 years of experience in inside sales within cybersecurity, SaaS, or related industries, with proven success in managing sales cycles and engaging with decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Success&lt;/strong&gt;: A demonstrated history of consistently meeting or exceeding sales quotas and driving revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong understanding of cybersecurity, SaaS, or networking solutions, with awareness of current market trends and competitive positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship-Driven&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to build long-term, trust-based relationships with key stakeholders and decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience working with partners, MSSPs, VARs, and other strategic collaborators to drive sales and expand business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-JW1&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;What Cognite is:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Relentless&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;to achieve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cognite operates at the forefront of &lt;strong&gt;industrial digitalization, building AI&lt;/strong&gt;, and data solutions that solve the world’s hardest, highest-impact problems. With unmatched industrial heritage and a comprehensive suite of AI capabilities, including low-code AI agents, Cognite accelerates the digital transformation to drive operational improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We thrive in challenges. We challenge assumptions. We execute with speed and ownership. If you view obstacles as signals to step forward - not backwards - you’ll feel right at home here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognite.com/en/company/newsroom/cognite-s-industrial-ai-momentum-soars-driving-ecosystem-impact-at-global-conference&quot;&gt;Moonshot&lt;/a&gt; is bold: Unlock $100B in customer value by 2035, and redefine how global industry works. Join us in this venture where AI and data meet ingenuity, and together, we will forge the path to a smarter, more connected industrial future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; width=&quot;708&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À propos de Cognite&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cognite est un éditeur mondial de logiciels d&#39;intelligence artificielle industrielle qui accompagne les secteurs à forte intensité d&#39;actifs dans leur transformation numérique à grande échelle. Notre plateforme phare, &lt;strong&gt;Cognite Data Fusion®&lt;/strong&gt;, combinée à nos solutions d’intelligence artificielle générative et agentique (&lt;strong&gt;Atlas AI&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;Cognite Flows&lt;/strong&gt;), convertit des données industrielles complexes en indicateurs exploitables en temps réel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre ambition : générer &lt;strong&gt;100 milliards de dollars de valeur concrète pour nos clients d&#39;ici 2035&lt;/strong&gt;. Pour atteindre cet objectif, nous veillons à ce que nos technologies de pointe se traduisent par une appropriation opérationnelle réelle, pérenne et ancrée dans le quotidien de nos clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rejoignez une équipe qui façonne l’avenir de l’industrie grâce à l’IA&lt;em&gt;. &lt;/em&gt;En tant que &lt;strong&gt;Value &amp;amp; Adoption Lead&lt;/strong&gt;, votre mission principale sera de pérenniser l’appropriation des solutions Cognite au sein de nos comptes stratégiques les plus complexes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Avec des milliers d’utilisateurs actifs sur le terrain, des installations industrielles multiples et des produits de données en production, nos partenariats de co-innovation majeurs s&#39;inscrivent dans des transformations de l&#39;IA sur plusieurs années.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans ce rôle, vous ferez le pont entre le déploiement technique et la concrétisation de la valeur métier. En étroite collaboration avec les clients et l&#39;équipe des comptes stratégiques, vous pilotez de bout en bout l’intégration de nos technologies — telles que l’IA agentique, Flows et Adaptive Expériences — dans le quotidien opérationnel des ingénieurs sur site, des planificateurs de maintenance et des équipes de direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos responsabilités&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Piloter la création et le suivi de la valeur :&lt;/strong&gt; Garantir la trajectoire de valeur à travers quatre dimensions clés du compte (&lt;strong&gt;Rétention → Activation des utilisateurs → Intégration dans les processus de travail → Mesure des résultats business&lt;/strong&gt;). Maintenir un tableau de bord consolidé de la valeur générée, servant de référence incontournable pour les décideurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structurer la démarche d&#39;accompagnement et d&#39;adoption :&lt;/strong&gt; Transformer les actions de support ponctuelles en un programme d&#39;adoption formalisé, reproductible et déployable à grande échelle. Concevoir des parcours ciblés via Cognite Academy, mettre en place des formations de formateurs et encadrer les phases de transition vers un support renforcé.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fédérer un réseau de référents internes :&lt;/strong&gt; Identifier, mobiliser et former les relais d’opinion et utilisateurs clés sur chaque site pour assurer l&#39;autonomie à long terme du client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diagnostiquer et lever les blocages :&lt;/strong&gt; Mener des analyses rigoureuses en cas de ralentissement de l&#39;utilisation des outils (formation, ergonomie, processus internes). Coordonner les équipes transverses — Delivery, ingénierie terrain, Academy et Customer Success — pour lever rapidement ces obstacles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agir en conseiller stratégique :&lt;/strong&gt; Dialoguer avec les dirigeants clients (directeurs des opérations, responsables d&#39;actifs, directeurs de la transformation) pour aligner les indicateurs opérationnels (KPI) sur les capacités technologiques, et traduire des concepts complexes en impacts économiques mesurables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industrialiser la pratique :&lt;/strong&gt; Contribuer à l&#39;enrichissement du cadre méthodologique global &lt;em&gt;Value &amp;amp; Adoption&lt;/em&gt; de Cognite en créant des guides opérationnels (playbooks), des indicateurs et des outils de diagnostic réutilisables pour l&#39;ensemble de notre portefeuille stratégique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maîtrise des environnements industriels :&lt;/strong&gt; Expérience solide dans l&#39;énergie, l&#39;industrie lourde ou le secteur pétrolier (Oil &amp;amp; Gas). Vous comprenez le terrain, parlez&amp;nbsp; le langage des équipes opérationnelles et inspirez immédiatement confiance, de l&#39;atelier au comité de direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience en conduite du changement :&lt;/strong&gt; Historique avéré dans le pilotage de programmes de transformation numérique à grande échelle, de déploiement technologique ou de conseil stratégique en milieu industriel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture de la valeur et appétence produit :&lt;/strong&gt; Dynamisme et curiosité avérée pour assimiler notre suite de solutions d’IA (Flows, Atlas AI, outils agentiques) afin de relier directement performance produit et résultats d&#39;entreprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aptitude relationnelle et esprit d’équipe :&lt;/strong&gt; Excellente aisance relationnelle, capable d&#39;échanger avec aisance aussi bien avec des techniciens de maintenance qu’avec des cadres dirigeants lors des revues de performance trimestrielles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rigueur et sens de l’organisation :&lt;/strong&gt; Capacité à structurer un rythme de travail exigeant. Aptitude à suivre des indicateurs quantitatifs (utilisateurs actifs mensuels, profondeur d&#39;usage, réduction des coûts opérationnels) tout en gérant des projets transverses complexes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Appétence pour l&#39;intelligence artificielle :&lt;/strong&gt; Utilisation proactive des outils augmentés par l’IA au quotidien (génération de contenus, personnalisation des supports, synthèse de rapports exécutifs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que nous offrons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Une mission à fort impact :&lt;/strong&gt; Une responsabilité directe sur la réussite des comptes de co-innovation IA les plus stratégiques de Cognite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Des perspectives d’évolution :&lt;/strong&gt; Une trajectoire définie vers un poste &lt;strong&gt;Senior&lt;/strong&gt;, offrant une exposition privilégiée aux enjeux de direction de comptes, de stratégie produit et de leadership auprès de clients grands comptes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Une culture de l’innovation :&lt;/strong&gt; L&#39;opportunité de collaborer avec des experts de premier plan qui redéfinissent les standards de l&#39;industrie.&lt;/li&gt;
